IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCESS44.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-TOTAL-TESTS PIC 99 VALUE 6.
01 WS-I PIC 99 VALUE ZERO.

01 WS-TEST-TABLE.
   05 WS-TEST-RECORD OCCURS 6 TIMES.
      10 WS-ROLE PIC X(10).
      10 WS-ACTION PIC X(10).
      10 WS-ACCOUNT-ID PIC X(10).

01 WS-NORMAL-ROLE PIC X(10).
01 WS-NORMAL-ACTION PIC X(10).

01 WS-DECISION PIC X(5).
01 WS-MASKED-ACCOUNT PIC X(10).

01 WS-ALLOW-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-DENY-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-ERROR-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE ZERO.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

MAIN-PARA.

    PERFORM LOAD-TEST-DATA

    DISPLAY "================================"
    DISPLAY " ACCESS CONTROL EVALUATION"
    DISPLAY "================================"

    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1
       UNTIL WS-I > WS-TOTAL-TESTS

       PERFORM PROCESS-REQUEST

    END-PERFORM

    DISPLAY "================================"
    DISPLAY "       FINAL REPORT"
    DISPLAY "================================"

    DISPLAY "ALLOW COUNT: " WS-ALLOW-COUNT
    DISPLAY "DENY COUNT: " WS-DENY-COUNT
    DISPLAY "ERROR COUNT: " WS-ERROR-COUNT

    DISPLAY "PROCESSING COMPLETED"

    STOP RUN.

LOAD-TEST-DATA.

    MOVE 'AUDITOR' TO WS-ROLE(1)
    MOVE 'VIEW' TO WS-ACTION(1)
    MOVE '1234567890' TO WS-ACCOUNT-ID(1)

    MOVE 'AUDITOR' TO WS-ROLE(2)
    MOVE 'WITHDRAW' TO WS-ACTION(2)
    MOVE '9876543210' TO WS-ACCOUNT-ID(2)

    MOVE 'auditor' TO WS-ROLE(3)
    MOVE 'view' TO WS-ACTION(3)
    MOVE '4567891234' TO WS-ACCOUNT-ID(3)

    MOVE 'UNKNOWN' TO WS-ROLE(4)
    MOVE 'VIEW' TO WS-ACTION(4)
    MOVE '1234567890' TO WS-ACCOUNT-ID(4)

    MOVE 'AUDITOR' TO WS-ROLE(5)
    MOVE 'DELETE' TO WS-ACTION(5)
    MOVE '9876543210' TO WS-ACCOUNT-ID(5)

    MOVE 'UNKNOWN' TO WS-ROLE(6)
    MOVE 'UNKNOWN' TO WS-ACTION(6)
    MOVE '12A4567890' TO WS-ACCOUNT-ID(6).

PROCESS-REQUEST.

    MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(
       FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ROLE(WS-I)))
       TO WS-NORMAL-ROLE

    MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(
       FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ACTION(WS-I)))
       TO WS-NORMAL-ACTION

    MOVE 'DENY' TO WS-DECISION

    DISPLAY "--------------------------------"

    DISPLAY "ROLE: " WS-NORMAL-ROLE
    DISPLAY "ACTION: " WS-NORMAL-ACTION

    PERFORM CHECK-PERMISSION

    PERFORM MASK-ACCOUNT

    IF WS-DECISION = 'ALLOW'

       ADD 1 TO WS-ALLOW-COUNT

    ELSE

       ADD 1 TO WS-DENY-COUNT

    END-IF

    DISPLAY "DECISION: " WS-DECISION

    IF WS-ERROR-COUNT > 0
       DISPLAY "ACCOUNT: INVALID"
    ELSE
       DISPLAY "ACCOUNT: " WS-MASKED-ACCOUNT
    END-IF.

CHECK-PERMISSION.

    EVALUATE TRUE

       WHEN WS-NORMAL-ROLE = 'AUDITOR'
        AND WS-NORMAL-ACTION = 'VIEW'

          MOVE 'ALLOW' TO WS-DECISION

       WHEN WS-NORMAL-ROLE = 'AUDITOR'
        AND WS-NORMAL-ACTION = 'WITHDRAW'

          MOVE 'DENY' TO WS-DECISION

       WHEN OTHER

          MOVE 'DENY' TO WS-DECISION

    END-EVALUATE.

MASK-ACCOUNT.

    MOVE '******' TO WS-MASKED-ACCOUNT(1:6)

    IF WS-ACCOUNT-ID(WS-I) IS NUMERIC

       MOVE WS-ACCOUNT-ID(WS-I)(7:4)
         TO WS-MASKED-ACCOUNT(7:4)

    ELSE

       MOVE 'INVALID' TO WS-MASKED-ACCOUNT

       ADD 1 TO WS-ERROR-COUNT

    END-IF.
